        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iimuchu nea gweaneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U jea oombala, ak gayghahoana madeadaang'u eemoojiga saang'a, siguura fuga Hiti ea Girgashi, ea Amori, ea fuga Ganaani, ea Berisi ea Yebusi, eemooji ispwa hees mideawa uurjeenga burdeaweegwa agooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwayiin NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U geatingaagu ak ghoajoarji; ak gajahuyda saawa; ak ea adiidu gisini neajeeda sea fiisu, nea adiidu giihiimsi baydeayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu googeenay geat sea saawa, ak ghoatawji haweegeagwa orjooga nyaawa, ghana ghaghi haweega nyaawa orjoogeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gayghwayam orjoogeagwa eameana geeshteanyu, ak ghabwat aseecheeka suuk, abeeda gaygwanyareekseegwa NG'UTAMIIDA, ak Gaydahuuydaneegwa nea mayghwashing'da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gajagadiyeesiina saawa: ak gajanyarjeaweada heanyaawa bea wagiida, nea ghoabwaanyaadi daranajeega nyaawa gamaning'iidi, ak ghoalaji Asherimu, ak ghoaghwardi sanaamajeega nyaawa aba beasta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba agooga goowooschi eemeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA: NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nighwaleagwa ahuwa fugaaschi jea gwahearaniischi, mida bugusta eemoojiga mida badayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini meagwalneegwa aba gideaba goowooschi saang'a, ea aburdeawana eemoojiga suurja, aba gideaba niyiin NG'UTAMIIDA bariinyeagaaschi badahuukeagwa aba gideaba agooga goowooschi ng'ay muuchi aba jeeda eemoojiga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba nih gweagu gideaba ghabwariinyeegwa NG'UTAMIIDA ak ea gudugoodiiw neajeeda ghayi sin sea ghweanigeagwa; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gooruuneegwa aba geatindaanyi hoauur, lealneegwa aba heeda oosisi gadiyeeda soomjeandumeeda, gooruuneegwa aba geatinga Farao was sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nala gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U niny ASEETA, was ASEETA waam adiiwi neajeadaanyi ea bariinyeega huumwa, aba heeda fuga bwariiy niny nea gwasissa mureeda diigheanyeekaaschi, ea gagul seaygoojiga hita sagalama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gayghawalda aba madeanyaawa bea fugiga sit ninyiin, ak ghwalas uhuuda; ak ea mayghabealbeal aba siida sit niny, gayghawalda aba madeeda gheanyangaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda shageada muuchi, ak giing'waanyi digheanyeeka ea deaweedajeega ea huumeanyeeka earukuneeyiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghawooda aba badayda mureeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghamneawa iileeysiit deaweedajeegeasu ak gisisi mureeda, abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygwasissa uurda neajeadaanyi ea bariinyeagaaschi bea huumwa abeeda aksa habeawooda ghweanigeagwa gideaba eang'waanya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gayghabwariinyi, ak gaygagoonyi ghawooda, ak gayghoahaat jeacheengaagu; aba ng'ata gayghoadaw ghawooda jeacheengaagu, ea haghweega madamnyeandaang'u, gaygang'usha boagaagu ea difaayeadaang'u ea nagheadaang'u, nea ghoahaada dugwaagu ea dayeega nooga, aba ng'eanyiida aksa habeawooda ghweanigeagwa gideaba gaygwanyakneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i gajeegoonyi ghawooda burdeawa dea eemoojiga suurja; ak ea maygwanda jeedeang'wa siida majiila nea eara jeeda hawandeang'wa ng'eedeeda ghana gatmooda maji, ghana aba jeeda dugweagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwasach NG'UTAMIIDA geeyoonung'weaka sean aba jeedeang'wa; nea ea maygudu ghoahaaknyi geeyoonung'weaka munyas bea ng'eanyiida Misri, ghayi inali, gaydageandeawaneey, ak ghwayiin badahuuka fuga sean sinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaylasa uhuuda buuneeda sean jea ghwayiin NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U geatingaagu, adiidu ghabwayda gheang'daang'u, nea adiidu gibwadi aseecheeka nyaawa, aba gideaba ng'asheanji gajiidu ghoah ghaseeda aba headaang'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghamneawa iiyeeni aba gurooroadaang'u; ak giyeeni ‘Eemoojisu ea hees uurjeeni ea gaburdeawean; gaydaamuustaan dahoan fiisu?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i adiidu giiwali saawa, ang'iing'i apkaada gida ghayi sima NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U Farao ea fugaaschi sean bea ng'eanyiida Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea bayiiga hees ghayi ideaksi geaw aba gheanyangaagu ea gwadeagwajeega ea ng'asheega deamdeameadi ea geatinda ASEATAANG'U; hean nih gichea gwasima NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U eemoojiga iiwali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gayghang'uda eemoojigiga muuwda, nea fugiga was boosteangean funya geat aba heedeang'wean gajealas uhuuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ghoabealnyi fiisu; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gwanda jeadaang'u, ASEETA haw uur mideawa gharbeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gayghahoana madeadaang'u eemoojisu nea gwasawan gili mwanang'; adiidu giduulu aba eaweecheanjagi, adiidu ghwasaang'ayiit diyeanga jarooda ea gaburdeaweey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaygagoonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U fiisu, ak ghwanung' gwahirbaban fiisu muuchi, ea eeyi bwak ea ealas uhuuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwayiin sugoodiga nyaawa geatindaang'u, ak gaynung' gwarooda gheawunga nyaawa aba hing'eadayda humng'eeda, ak ea manda siichea ghoamu ghamiinaada aba madeadaang'u ea eeyi bwak ea lasa uhuuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea haleanjeeda nyaawa sibada mawoosa aseecheeka gayghwarda aba beasta; adiidu gilaji ghuut lapiyeeda nyaawa ghana lagheanga nyaawa meeng'meeng'i mida geatinga nyaawa, adiidu googeandi ghoah geagwa, adiidu ghaghasnyi, aba gideaba munyinda gil aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giyiin jeedeaba gheang'u haleanjeeda munyas, abeeda gaynyasa mooshteayda uurji daanyaawa, sida muuchi nea giheawi aba gideaba nih gidasimwaashta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
